# Development-only files, kept out of the release package.
#
# Two reasons, not one.  The obvious: a player does not need the suite.  The
# load-bearing one: modkit's MK006 scan walks the same file list the packer
# does, and a test legitimately requires src.mods.Runtime and src.ui.Screens
# to drive the hooks -- reaches the MOD never makes.  Without this, packing
# would demand the engine_internals permission for code that never ships,
# and the manager would show players a PATCHES ENGINE CODE badge for it.
#
# Exact relative paths; the matcher is not a glob.
tests/Gen1MenuManager_test.lua
